599
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:21,600
actually a single, tightly

600
00:20:19,320 --> 00:20:23,720
interconnected financial system, where

601
00:20:21,600 --> 00:20:25,440
every tenant's fortune is quietly tied

602
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:27,240
